OL,3,GNEWSA'A Derry classic': Chicken Box
OL,4,Atakes centre stage at Rose of Tralee
OL,5,
OL,6,FA much-loved Londonderry takeaway
OL,7,Fstaple has been given a national
OL,8,Ftelevision spotlight after a local
OL,9,Fwoman demonstrated how to make a "Derry
OL,10,FChicken Box" during the Rose of Tralee
OL,11,Ffestival.
OL,13,FDerry Rose Cara Hamilton showcased the
OL,14,Ficonic dish alongside host Kathryn
OL,15,FThomas on Monday night.
OL,17,FCara told viewers she was "having
OL,18,Fwithdrawals" from Derry food as the
OL,19,Fpair put together their own version of
OL,20,Fthe Chicken Box on stage, including
OL,21,Fchips, chicken, peppers, cheese and of
OL,22,Fcourse taco sauce.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
