OL,3,GNEWSA'A Derry classic': Chicken Box
OL,4,Atakes centre stage at Rose of Tralee
OL,5,
OL,6,FCaoimhinn Campbell, whose family owns
OL,7,FKiera's Chippy in Top of the Hill in
OL,8,FDerry, said it was "very random" to see
OL,9,Fa Chicken Box being made live on
OL,10,Ftelevision, but he found it very funny.
